    narr:narration """The modernization of the analytics infrastructure is currently centered on the adoption of [Zypherion](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) as the primary database solution. This transition is driven by a [performance-based mandate](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) citing a projected 15x improvement in columnar query speeds. The operational rollout is [formally scheduled](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) to commence in the third quarter of 2026. These core components—the technology choice, the performance justification, and the implementation timeline—are codified across both [direct project statements](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) and [summary documentation](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) intended to solidify the organizational consensus regarding the migration path.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ;
